# One-off reports, scratch pages and analyses go here. A directory rather than a filename list:
# the list below only ever matched reports that already existed, so the next one written under a
# new name would have been committed by accident.
notes/

# The pre-existing reports, kept listed on purpose. These files are still sitting in the working
# tree; dropping their entries would not delete them, it would just make git start offering them
# up as new untracked files. Delete an entry once its file is gone or has moved into notes/.
CRASH_FIX_COMPLETED.md
DIAGNOSTIC_LOGS_ADDED.md
DIAGNOSTIC_LOGS_ENHANCED.md
LEAK_FIX_REPORT.md
P0_BUG_FIX_REPORT.md
TLS_TOAST_FIX_REPORT.md
TRANSPARENT_FIXES_REPORT.md
USER_IMPACT_ANALYSIS.md
liquid_glass_demo.html
